title: Janssen CoMSES Model

! Janssen's Artificial Anasazi (CoMSES)

Marco Janssen's NetLogo replication of Artificial Anasazi is the source of the NetLogo Models Library version, and so of every model on this site. The Models Library page says it is a lightly adapted version of Janssen's replication, which he built with help from Sean Bergin and Allen Lee, and that its info tab is adapted from the ODD description that accompanies his model.

